| `comp:chat/MessageList` | Scrollable message bubbles bound to the thread store; reflects optimistic + reconciled state. |  | — |
| `comp:chat/TypingIndicator` | Animated dots when the peer is typing; bound to a transient view state. |  | — |
| `screen:chat/ConversationInfo` | Conversation/group details: participants, shared media, and mute/notification settings (display + settings surface). |  | — |
