| `screen:chat/NewGroup` | Create a group: name it, pick participants, then open the new group thread. |  | — |
| `screen:chat/Profile` | A participant's contact/profile card, reached from the participant list. |  | — |
| `screen:chat/Search` | Search across conversations and messages from the inbox; tap a result to open its thread. |  | — |
| `screen:chat/Settings` | App settings: account, notifications, privacy. |  | — |
| `screen:chat/SharedMedia` | Grid of all images/attachments shared in the conversation; tap a thumbnail to open the viewer. |  | — |
| `screen:chat/Thread` | One conversation: message log + compose bar; optimistic send + realtime inbound land here. |  | renders→comp:chat/ComposeBar; renders→comp:chat/MessageBubble; renders→comp:chat/MessageList; renders→comp:chat/TypingIndicator |

## logic

| id | intent | slice | key out-edges |
|---|---|---|---|
| `act:info/GoBack` | Pop conversation info back to the thread. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/ConversationInfo |
| `act:info/OpenProfile` | Push the tapped participant's profile. |  | navigates→screen:chat/Profile |
| `act:info/OpenSharedMedia` | Push the shared-media grid. |  | navigates→screen:chat/SharedMedia |
| `act:list/OpenNewConversation` | Push the new-conversation recipient picker. |  | navigates→screen:chat/NewConversation |
| `act:list/OpenSearch` | Push the search screen. |  | navigates→screen:chat/Search |
| `act:list/OpenSettings` | Push the settings screen. |  | navigates→screen:chat/Settings |
| `act:list/OpenThread` | Push the tapped conversation's thread. |  | navigates→screen:chat/Thread |
| `act:list/StartCompose` | Create a draft conversation AND open its thread (save-and-advance, G15). |  | navigates→screen:chat/Thread; writes→store:ConversationStore |
| `act:newconv/GoBack` | Dismiss the recipient picker back to the inbox. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/NewConversation |
| `act:newconv/OpenNewGroup` | Push the group-creation screen. |  | navigates→screen:chat/NewGroup |
| `act:newconv/StartThread` | Open the chosen recipient's thread. |  | navigates→screen:chat/Thread |
| `act:newgroup/CreateGroup` | Create the group conversation and open its thread (save-and-advance). |  | navigates→screen:chat/Thread; writes→store:ConversationStore |
| `act:newgroup/GoBack` | Dismiss group creation back to the recipient picker. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/NewGroup |
| `act:profile/GoBack` | Pop the profile back to conversation info. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/Profile |
| `act:search/GoBack` | Pop search back to the inbox. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/Search |
| `act:search/OpenResult` | Push the tapped result's conversation thread. |  | navigates→screen:chat/Thread |
| `act:settings/GoBack` | Dismiss settings back to the inbox. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/Settings |
| `act:shared/GoBack` | Pop shared media back to conversation info. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/SharedMedia |
| `act:shared/OpenMedia` | Present the tapped thumbnail fullscreen in the media viewer. |  | navigates→screen:chat/MediaViewer |
| `act:thread/EditDraft` | Write the typed text + validity into local compose view state. |  | — |
| `act:thread/GoBack` | Pop the thread back to the inbox. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/Thread |
| `act:thread/IngestInbound` | Hand the arrived realtime payload to the ingest stage. |  | guardedBy→assert:thread/SubscriptionActive; invokes→stage:rt/Ingest; writes→store:InboundBuffer |
| `act:thread/OpenInfo` | Push the conversation/group info screen. |  | navigates→screen:chat/ConversationInfo |
| `act:thread/OpenMedia` | Present the tapped image fullscreen in the media viewer. |  | navigates→screen:chat/MediaViewer |
| `act:thread/PresentPicker` | Present the OS photo/attachment picker. |  | navigates→x-ext:pick/AttachmentSheet |
| `act:thread/RetrySend` | Re-flip a failed message back to sending and re-invoke the send op (idempotent on the client-message id). |  | guardedBy→assert:thread/MessageFailed; invokes→op:chat/SendMessage; writes→store:ThreadStore |
| `act:thread/SendMessage` | Optimistically append the message, invoke the send backend op, emit a haptic (guarded by non-empty draft). |  | guardedBy→assert:thread/DraftSendable; invokes→op:chat/SendMessage; invokes→op:chat/UploadAttachment; writes→store:ThreadStore |
| `act:thread/Subscribe` | Subscribe to the realtime channel and load message history. |  | guardedBy→assert:thread/ConversationResolved; invokes→stage:rt/Ingest |
| `act:viewer/GoBack` | Dismiss the media viewer back to its opener. |  | dismisses→screen:chat/MediaViewer |
| `assert:thread/AttachmentValid` | The picked attachment passes type and size limits before the upload op runs. |  | — |
| `assert:thread/Connected` | The connection is up (realtime/network reachable) before the send op is attempted; offline blocks/queues the POST. |  | — |
| `assert:thread/ConversationResolved` | The conversation is resolved/known before subscribing to its channel and loading its history. |  | — |
| `assert:thread/DraftSendable` | Draft has non-empty text or an attachment, and no send is already in flight. |  | — |
| `assert:thread/MessageFailed` | The target message record is currently in the failed state; retry is only valid on a send that has actually failed. |  | — |
| `assert:thread/SubscriptionActive` | A realtime subscription/channel is active before an inbound frame is ingested; orphan frames off a dead socket are dropped. |  | — |
| `trig:info/Back` | User taps back from conversation info. |  | — |
| `trig:info/MediaTap` | User taps the shared-media section to see all media. |  | — |
| `trig:info/ParticipantTap` | User taps a participant in the conversation info. |  | — |
| `trig:list/ComposeTap` | User taps the new-message compose button. |  | — |
