## substrate

| id | intent | slice | key out-edges |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ds:realtime/Socket` | Realtime websocket: inbound message + presence/typing fan-in origin. |  | — |
| `fx:analytics/AttachmentPicked` | Analytics: attachment_picked. |  | — |
| `fx:analytics/MessageSent` | Analytics: message_sent. |  | — |
| `fx:haptic/Send` | Light haptic tap on send. |  | — |
| `op:chat/SendMessage` | POST the message to the server; confirms or fails the optimistic record. |  | guardedBy→assert:thread/Connected |
| `op:chat/UploadAttachment` | Upload the picked attachment and return a media token. |  | guardedBy→assert:thread/AttachmentValid; produces→store:ThreadStore |
| `stage:rt/Ingest` | Realtime inbound ingest: dedup, order, and reconcile inbound frames into the thread store. |  | produces→store:ThreadStore |
| `store:ContactsStore` | Contacts / known users directory: backs profile cards and the recipient picker. |  | — |
| `store:ConversationStore` | Conversation list: participants, last-message preview, unread counts. |  | — |
| `store:CurrentUserStore` | Signed-in user account and session/profile. |  | — |
| `store:InboundBuffer` | Raw realtime inbound frames staged off the socket before dedup/ordering. |  | — |
| `store:NotificationSettingsStore` | Per-conversation mute / notification preferences. |  | — |
| `store:ThreadStore` | Source of truth for messages in the open thread; holds optimistic + confirmed records keyed by client-message id. |  | — |

